---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About — Conatus Real Estate Inc."
  description="Conatus Real Estate Inc. builds AI-powered operations platforms for regulated industries. Deep operational expertise in SFR, powered by Claude."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container--narrow">
      <p class="page-label">About</p>
      <h1>The operator's edge.<br /><span class="accent">AI-native</span> delivery.</h1>

      <div class="prose">
        <p class="lead">
          Conatus Real Estate Inc. was built by an operator. After 4,000+ SFR transactions
          and $1B+ in acquisitions capital deployed across multiple institutional platforms,
          one thing became clear: the systems operators need are best designed by someone
          who's needed them. Claude makes those systems faster and cheaper to build than ever before.
        </p>

        <h2>What We Do</h2>
        <p>Conatus offers three services under its Ops &amp; Tech Consulting business line:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Operational Platform Development</strong> &mdash; Custom software platforms built for how your operations actually work, not how a product manager imagines they work. Purpose-built tools that execute at scale.</li>
          <li><strong>Claude Integration</strong> &mdash; MCP integrations, autonomous agent workflows, and AI-native tools embedded in your existing stack — not bolted on as a chatbot afterthought.</li>
          <li><strong>Operational Analytics &amp; Technical Consulting</strong> &mdash; Data infrastructure, analytics pipelines, and technical strategy for operators who need faster, better-informed decisions.</li>
        </ul>
        <p><a href="/#services">See all services &rarr;</a></p>

        <h2>Responsible AI Posture</h2>
        <p>
          We take a clear stance on how AI should be used in regulated industries:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Human review on all recommendations</strong> — AI provides analysis and surfaces insights, but every recommendation is reviewed by a human before action is taken.</li>
          <li><strong>AI as an analysis layer</strong> — Claude powers data processing, pattern recognition, and workflow automation. It does not make final decisions on transactions, compliance determinations, or client-facing advice.</li>
          <li><strong>Transparent to clients</strong> — When AI is part of a workflow, clients know. No black boxes.</li>
          <li><strong>Compliant with disclosure requirements</strong> — All AI-assisted processes are designed to meet California real estate disclosure requirements and applicable regulations.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>What Sets Us Apart</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Operational depth</strong> &mdash; We've built and operated platforms that executed thousands of real estate transactions. The requirements don't come from interviews — they come from experience.</li>
          <li><strong>Regulated industry focus</strong> &mdash; We understand compliance requirements, audit trails, and the operational constraints of regulated industries from the inside.</li>
          <li><strong>Production systems</strong> &mdash; Not prototypes or demos — purpose-built platforms running real operations at scale.</li>
          <li><strong>AI-native development</strong> &mdash; Claude is how we deliver: faster, more consistent, and at a cost traditional development shops can't match — especially ones that also lack the domain background.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Domain Expertise</h2>
        <p>
          Our deepest expertise is in single-family residential real estate — acquisitions,
          SFR asset management, HCV operations, and compliance. We're applying the same
          approach across financial services, private lending, and broader asset management,
          building purpose-built platforms informed by direct operational experience.
        </p>

        <h2>Leadership</h2>
        <p>
          Conatus Real Estate is led by Ted Farry, whose career spans
          institutional acquisitions, affordable housing, and technology
          platform development — including his roles as Founder &amp; CEO of
          Homestead Affordable and COO of Fortune Acquisitions.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="/leadership">Full leadership bio &rarr;</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

